  <text>
      <body>
         <p>Was a practical man.</p>
         <p>He said, Till the soil</p>
         <p>And learn from the land.</p>
         <p>Let down your bucket</p> 
         <p>Where you are</p>
         <p>Your fate is here</p>
         <p>And not afar</p>
         <p>To help yourself</p>
      </body>
  </text>
</TEI>
